{"text": " Welcome to my ultimate Gitmastery course. Over the next five hours, you're going to learn everything you need to know to use Git like a pro and work effectively with others. We're going to start off by talking about the fundamental concepts like what is Git, how to install and configure it, and then in each section, we're going to explore a different set of Git tools. We'll cover creating snapshots of your code, browsing your project history, branching and merging, collaborating with others using GitHub, and rewriting history. I'm Mosh Hamidani and I'm super excited to be your instructor. Now let's jump in and get started.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.04, "text": " Welcome to my ultimate Gitmastery course.", "tokens": [50364, 4027, 281, 452, 9705, 16939, 21640, 88, 1164, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18954452872276306, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.07276808470487595}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.04, "end": 7.2, "text": " Over the next five hours, you're going to learn everything you need to know to use Git", "tokens": [50566, 4886, 264, 958, 1732, 2496, 11, 291, 434, 516, 281, 1466, 1203, 291, 643, 281, 458, 281, 764, 16939, 50724], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18954452872276306, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.07276808470487595}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 7.2, "end": 9.68, "text": " like a pro and work effectively with others.", "tokens": [50724, 411, 257, 447, 293, 589, 8659, 365, 2357, 13, 50848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18954452872276306, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.07276808470487595}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 9.68, "end": 14.120000000000001, "text": " We're going to start off by talking about the fundamental concepts like what is Git,", "tokens": [50848, 492, 434, 516, 281, 722, 766, 538, 1417, 466, 264, 8088, 10392, 411, 437, 307, 16939, 11, 51070], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18954452872276306, "compress